Viktor 13.10.2026: «Воркспейс обрезан до буквы, а перед ним туева хуча свободного места».

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 6372f78..20778c4 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -3905,6 +3905,9 @@ body[data-tab="post"] .lib-refined { display: inline-flex; }
     padding: 7px 10px;
   }
   body[data-tab="create"] .library .take-title { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }
+  /* HERESY 1425 (Viktor 13.10.2026: «Воркспейс обрезан до буквы, а перед ним туева хуча свободного места»): the title row (1421) across the
+     card too; left in the first column, its width (a long title and its tags) widened that column, and the workspace under it got a letter */
+  body[data-tab="create"] .library .take-head { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
   body[data-tab="create"] .library .take-style { display: none; }
   body[data-tab="create"] .library .take-foot { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; margin: 0; flex-wrap: nowrap; white-space: nowrap; }
   body[data-tab="create"] .library .take-extra { display: contents; }
